sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to send a Local Authorization list to the Charging Station<br>with type Differential and AuthorizationData elements without idTokenInfo in the message

    loop Repeated if the Local Authorization List is too big for one message
        CSMS->>CS: SendLocalListRequest (updateType = Differential, versionNumber, localAuthorizationList)
        Note over CSMS: Validation: updateType must be Differential<br>versionNumber must be bigger than currently configured in Test System<br>localAuthorizationList must contain AuthorizationData elements without idTokenInfo
        CS-->>CSMS: SendLocalListResponse (status = Accepted)
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
